🎮 Ode to the Game 🎮
In pixel lands where heroes rise,
Through dungeons deep and starry skies.
A warrior’s quest, a racer’s track,
A world beyond—no turning back.

With sword in hand or spells so bright,
We battle foes through endless night.
A kingdom lost, a prize to claim,
The thrill of life inside the game.

The clock ticks on, yet time stands still,
Each boss we face, each test of skill.
A jump, a dodge, a perfect play,
We chase the dream, we seize the day.

For every loss, we try once more,
Respawn, reset, unlock the door.
Through joy and rage, through win or fall,
The game unites—one world, one call.

So press Start, embrace the fight,
Adventure calls—into the night! 🎮✨